@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Find the receipt for your purchase - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Buying items";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Find the receipt for your purchase";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_area/help_centre_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>When you buy something on Lively, you'll receive an email receipt for every purchase, and you can view your order details anytime in the app or website.</p>

        <p><strong>Your receipt includes:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Subtotal:</strong> the cost of the item you purchased.</li>
            <li><strong>Shipping costs:</strong> if items are bundled, the receipt shows the shipping cost for that specific item. To see the shipping costs associated with other items in the bundle, check their individual receipts.</li>
            <li><strong>Taxes:</strong> any applicable sales tax.</li>
            <li><strong>Shipping address:</strong> where the order will be delivered.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment method (email only):</strong> for example, the type of credit card used and the last four digits.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Tip:</strong> If you purchased during a show, you'll also get a video receipt with a short clip of the item you bought. Video receipts are available for 60 days. <a asp-action="FindReceipt">How to view your video receipt.</a>
        </div>

        <h2>View your receipt on the Lively app</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Tap <strong>Activity</strong> at the bottom of the screen.</li>
            <li>Go to the <strong>Purchases</strong> tab and select your item.</li>
            <li>Scroll down and tap <strong>Receipt &amp; shipping details.</strong></li>
        </ol>

        <h2>View your receipt on Lively.com</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Sign into Lively.<a href="https://lively.com">com</a>.</li>
            <li>Open the <strong>Wallet</strong> tab.</li>
            <li>Under Transaction history, select your item.</li>
            <li>Check Receipt</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>